    "profile_text": {
        "body": "AeroVironment Inc describes itself as a leading manufacturer of Unmanned Aircraft Systems, Unmanned Aerial Vehicles, Loitering Munition Systems, and Unmanned Ground Vehicles used for surveillance and reconnaissance by the United States Military, U.S. allies, and Commercial Industries. The company also says it manufactures High-Altitude Pseudo-Satellites.\n\nThe company's advanced development group, MacCready Works, is described as turning concepts into mission-ready autonomous systems. It says its engineers, roboticists, and AI researchers design next-generation robotic systems across air, land, and sea, guided by what it calls the MacCready Method: build fast, test relentlessly, deploy advantage. The group is named in reference to Dr. Paul B. MacCready, Jr.\n\nAeroVironment Inc is a public company headquartered in Arlington, Virginia, with ticker AVAV and CIK 0001368622. The company has 152 legal exposure entries in Virginia.",
